# The companion is compiled into the shell and needs no file — it is always offered, and a config
# file cannot redefine it (the registry refuses, so a bad file cannot leave a machine with no
# working mind). This example is here to name the two kinds a file CAN declare.
#
# Copy one of these to ~/.config/yantrik/harnesses/<id>.yaml and edit it.

id: mind
name: Yantrik Mind
kind: openai-http
endpoint: http://127.0.0.1:8080/v1
model: default
enabled: false
